msgid "Days remaining (number only)"
msgstr "Días restantes (solo número)"

msgid ""
"Decorative fonts may use synthetic bold or italic if the selected face has "
"only one style."
msgstr ""
"Las fuentes decorativas pueden simular negrita o cursiva si la familia solo "
"tiene un estilo."

